From: =?utf-8?b?T25kxZllaiBTdXLDvQ==?= <ondrej@sury.org>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:21:28 +0100
Subject: Skip the session upload progress tests

0161-Avoid-state-corruption-via-bailout.patch disables the session upload
progress, so the tests that expect the progress data in the session cannot
pass.
